From 4448fdf669bc29fe5dbaddb8a57081ad4c6c803c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lynxtron Authors <lynxtron@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 13:01:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] [Feature][Windowless] Support canvas background color and
 snapshot compositing

- Add Rasterizer::SetBackgroundColor / Shell::SetBackgroundColor / ClayHeadlessEngine::SetBackgroundColor to clear the offscreen canvas and force full-frame damage on updates

- Default ScreenshotRequest::background_color_ to std::nullopt so snapshots inherit the configured Rasterizer canvas background color (falling back to white when unset) and preserve non-opaque alpha in Skia snapshots

- Expose lynx_windowless_renderer_set_background_color and LynxWindowlessRenderer::SetBackgroundColor
